@startuml sequence_diagram
skinparam backgroundColor              #F8FAFC
skinparam ParticipantBackgroundColor   #EEF2FF
skinparam ParticipantBorderColor       #4F46E5
skinparam ActorBackgroundColor         #DBEAFE
skinparam ActorBorderColor             #2563EB
skinparam ArrowColor                   #4F46E5
skinparam ArrowFontSize                11
skinparam SequenceLifeLineBorderColor  #94A3B8

actor "User" as U
participant "Frontend\n(React / Vite)"     as F
participant "Inference API\n(Modal, T4)"   as G
participant "Agents API\n(FastAPI :8002)"  as API
participant "Agent 1\nExtractor"           as A1
participant "Agent 2\nAuditor"             as A2
participant "Agent 3\nAnalyst"             as A3
participant "Agent 4\nChatbot"             as A4
database "PostgreSQL"                      as PG
participant "Gmail SMTP"                   as MAIL

== 0. Authentication ==
U   ->  F   : username + password
F   ->  F   : local login (localStorage)
F   ->  API : POST /token
API --> F   : signed JWT (HS256)

== 1. Classification and extraction ==
U  ->  F  : upload a document (image / PDF)
F  ->  G  : POST /predict
G  ->  G  : MobileNetV2 → document type
G  ->  G  : GLM-OCR (invoice or bill model) → fields
G  --> F  : {entities, doc_type, timing}
F  --> U  : editable fields
U  ->  F  : review and correct the fields

== 2. Agents ==
F   ->  API : POST /analyse (file + corrected fields)
API ->  A1  : extraction: OCR / native PDF → LLM → vision → merge
A1  --> API : complete_entities
API ->  A2  : audit
A2  ->  PG  : duplicate check (document number)
PG  --> A2  : result
A2  ->  A2  : arithmetic, amount in words, due date, RIB, signatures → verdict
alt alert condition met
  A2 -> MAIL : alert e-mail
end
A2  --> API : audit_report + status_validite
API ->  A3  : analysis
A3  ->  PG  : supplier history (last 500 documents)
A3  ->  A3  : statistics, anomalies, LLM comment
A3  --> API : analyst_report + alert_level
API --> F   : complete report

opt correction after the report
  U  ->  F   : edit the fields
  F  ->  API : POST /audit, POST /analyst (no re-extraction)
  API --> F  : updated reports
end

F   ->  API : POST /save
API ->  PG  : INSERT documents + factures / traites
F   --> U   : report saved

== 3. Chatbot (optional) ==
U   ->  F   : question
F   ->  API : POST /chat (question + document context)
API ->  A4  : understand_intent
opt question about the history
  A4 -> PG  : query
end
A4  --> F   : answer
@enduml
